	quest.03378F948806CEF2.quest_subtitle: "If you get everything about Stratus, you can finally face every boss in Aether dimension. Good luck."
	quest.03378F948806CEF2.title: "This is my favourite armor set!"
	quest.035F1337E4E9FAA8.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Radial Chassis connects to a radius of blocks around it rather than a straight line of blocks.&r"
		""
		"This can be unwieldy if there are blocks nearby one would rather not connect to the Contraption."
		""
		"&6You can right click on the sides of the chassis while holding a Slimeball or Super Glue to make them sticky&r, and again to apply it to all sides. "
		""
		"The items are not consumed. "
		""
		"&6The radius of affected blocks can be changed per chassis with a Wrench.&r Hold Ctrl to scroll every connected chassis."
	]
	quest.035F1337E4E9FAA8.quest_subtitle: "The Radial Chassis is a block used to connect Contraptions."
	quest.035F1337E4E9FAA8.title: "&6Radial Chassis&r"
	quest.038E550C68E72B2A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Source Jars&r store source gathered from nearby &6Sourcelinks&r. Source is used in glyphs and rituals by powering devices like the &6Imbuement Chamber&r and &6Enchanting Apparatus&r."
		""
		"Source may be moved using a Source Relay or by breaking and moving it."
		""
		"To use Source in a jar, &6simply place&r the jar &6near your desired device&r, also Source Jars will provide a signal to Redstone Comparators based on their fill level."
	]
	quest.038E550C68E72B2A.quest_subtitle: "speed up the process..."
	quest.038E550C68E72B2A.title: "&6Source Jar&r"
	quest.03AC0BE6E06785D5.quest_desc: ["Sneak + right-click to store as much XP as possible. Right-click to retrieve all XP."]
