	quest.06F2A52ACD614FA2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME P2P Tunnel&r is a configurable block that &6acts as a secure&r, long-range \"portal\" to &6transport 32 AE2 channels across a network&r, bypassing the need for extensive, bulky &6dense cable lines&r. "
		""
		"It requires a &6memory card&r to pair an input tunnel with one or more output tunnels, efficiently &6expanding channel capacity&r. "
	]
