	quest.072725763D6D375B.quest_desc: [
		"Similar to the &6Universal Cable&r, the &6Thermodynamic Conductor is Mekanism's way of transferring power in the form of heat&r (essentially a heat pipe)."
		""
		"Transfer is lossy, depending on the biome the conductor is in. Warmer biomes have a higher transfer efficiency (i.e., less heat is lost), while colder biomes are lower (i.e., more heat is lost)."
	]
	quest.074BEBA382E7EDBB.quest_desc: ["Choose, modify and remove enchantments for your gear and tools. Repair your gear with levels without using Anvil."]
