	quest.07821466EC985E94.quest_desc: ["It enhances resource production, providing a +150% base increase for &aInferium crops&r and a 200% yield for others, often doubling or tripling output compared to &bregular farmland&r. It is crafted using &cTertium Essence&r and is crucial for efficient, mid-game resource farming."]
