	quest.099DE6F87EB15C33.quest_desc: [
		"&bME Item Storage Cells&r are &6digital storage units&r (1k to 256k+) crafted by combining a &6storage component with housing&r. "
		""
		"They store items in &bME Drives&r or &bChests&r, holding up to &663 distinct item&r types and vast quantities of items based on byte capacity rather than just item counts. "
	]
