	quest.0A5BB54AA4CA9BFC.quest_desc: [
		"How does it work? It works like this, place down the &6Teleport Pad&r on the ground and sneaking &6Shift + Right-click&r on it with an &6empty hand&r."
		""
		"From the &6Overworld&r you will be teleported in &6Mining Dimension&r to gather further &6AllTheModium&r, which is found on &6deepslate layers&r."
		""
		"From the &6Nether&r you will be teleported in &6The Other Dimension&r."
		""
		"From the &6End&r you will be teleported in &6Beyond Dimension&r, where... where, uhm, you can just fly. Don't go without Elytra."
	]
