	quest.0F0024FF26C2F825.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Export Bus&r is a &6cable sub-part&r used to automatically &6extract items&r from an &bME network&r and place them into an &6attached inventory&r (chests, furnaces, machines). "
		""
		"It requires &6power and a channel to function&r, acting as the opposite of an &bImport Bus&r. "
	]
	quest.0F0024FF26C2F825.quest_subtitle: "the export bus"
	quest.0F0024FF26C2F825.title: "&bME Export Bus&r"
	quest.0F0462282E982B9A.title: "&6Apprentice's Spell Book&r"
	quest.0F756CCA94029A3D.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMatter Cannon&r is a &6portable railgun&r that can fire &6small items as projectiles&r, like &bMatter Balls&r and metal nuggets. The damage depends on the item being fired, with \"heavier\" items like gold nuggets (10 damage) doing more damage than light items like &bmatter balls&r (2 damage). It consumes a &6base energy of 1600 AE per shot&r."
		""
		"When the config option &6\"matterCannonBlockDamage\" is true&r, the cannon &6will break blocks&r depending on their hardness and the damage of the ammunition."
		""
		"Its energy can be recharged in a &bCharger&r."
		""
		"&bMatter Cannons&r act like &bstorage cells&r, and their ammunition magazine can most easily be filled by sticking the cannon in the &bstorage cell&r slot in a &bME Chest&r."
	]
	quest.0F756CCA94029A3D.quest_subtitle: "railgun"
	quest.0F756CCA94029A3D.title: "&bMatter Cannon&r"
	quest.0FB720681E8629D2.title: "&6Tablet of Burrowing&r"
	quest.0FC8BD11DD40AFE8.quest_subtitle: "Aim and shoot."
	quest.0FC8BD11DD40AFE8.title: "Your first Bow."
	quest.1010919DAB3B56FF.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Portable Cell&r in AE2 is a handheld, &6battery-powered storage device&r that functions as a mobile, compact inventory, &6similar to a backpack or a portable terminal&r. "
		""
		"It allows players to access &6stored items&r on the go, &6requires charging&r, and can be placed into &bME drives&r or &bIO ports&r for integration into a &6larger system&r. "
	]
	quest.1010919DAB3B56FF.quest_subtitle: "Imagine having these between your hands in real life"
	quest.1010919DAB3B56FF.title: "&bME Portable Cell&r"
	quest.102591E7D0A27E5E.quest_subtitle: "Used to create White Spells"
	quest.102591E7D0A27E5E.title: "&6Divine Pearl&r"
	quest.105507F079675D4E.quest_desc: ["Made from &2Prudentium Essence&r and used to grow &6Tier 2 resource seeds&r (like &dAmethyst&r or &eCoral&r), offering faster growth and a higher chance (20% total)."]
	quest.105507F079675D4E.quest_subtitle: "&2Prudentium Farmland&r is a &6Tier 2 Essence Farmland&r"
