	quest.10B57FC8989CAE5E.title: "&6Black Eye"
	quest.10F1711282B85C32.quest_desc: [
		"The &bImport Bus&r pulls &6items and fluids&r (and whatever else, given addons) from the inventory it's touching and &6pushes them into network storage&r."
		""
		"For purposes of &6lag reduction&r, if the &bImport Bus&r has not imported something recently, it goes into a sort of \"sleep mode\" where it &6operates slowly&r, and wakes up and accelerates to full speed (4 operations per second) when it successfully imports something."
		""
		"They are &6cable subparts&r."
	]
	quest.10F1711282B85C32.quest_subtitle: "the import bus"
	quest.10F1711282B85C32.title: "&bME Import Bus&r"
	quest.10F55D26F7C1AAEF.quest_subtitle: "The Gravemaster's Key is an item dropped by killing Dread Lich, which enables the player to access the Mausoleum by putting it in a dread wood keyhole."
