	quest.147913D77183CD9F.quest_desc: [
		"The &bLevel Emitter&r emits a &credstone signal&r depending on the quantity of an item in &6network storage&r."
		""
		"There is also a version that emits a &credstone signal&r depending on the &6energy stored&r in your network."
		""
		"Items and fluids can be dragged into the slot from JEI/REI even if you don't actually have any of that item."
		""
		"Right-click with a &bfluid container&r (like a bucket or fluid tank) to set that fluid as a filter instead of the bucket or tank item."
		""
		"They are cable subparts."
		""
		"Unlike other devices, level emitters do not require a channel."
	]
	quest.147913D77183CD9F.quest_subtitle: "redstone, again"
	quest.147913D77183CD9F.title: "&bME Level Emitter&r"
	quest.148E75A82AFA6082.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bio-Generators&r produce electricity from &6Bio Fuel&r. "
		""
		"The generator will produce 5.6 kJ from a single item, and has an internal storage capacity of 160 kJ. "
		""
		"After this has been reached, the bio-generator can hold 24000 units of bio fuel to be processed later, which is equivalent to 240 items."
	]
	quest.148E75A82AFA6082.title: "&bBio-Generator&r"
	quest.14E7070BCBA732DC.quest_desc: [
		"For the &6Spell Parchment&r, you need to craft a Blank Parchment first."
		""
		"So you need to prepare the &6Scribe's Table&r down and right-click a Blank Parchment &6onto the table&r."
		""
		"After this, open your &6Spell Book&r and &6choose the specific spell&r you want to put onto the parchment, and then you can scribe the parchment crouching with Shift + Right Click the Scribe's Table."
		""
		"After this the spell will be transferred onto the parchment."
	]
