	quest.187DD7F87048F073.quest_desc: [
		"The &bColor Applicator&r is used to paint colorable blocks like &6cables&r, wool, terracotta, glass, and concrete. It uses paintballs or dyes, and snowballs can be used in order to clean &6color off of cables&r and paintball splotches off of blocks."
		""
		"Its energy can be recharged in a &bCharger&r."
		""
		"Color applicators act like storage cells, and their paint storage can most easily be filled by sticking the applicator in the &6storage cell&r slot in a &bME Chest&r."
		""
		"To use a color applicator, right click to apply, and shift-scroll to cycle through the stored paintballs and dyes."
	]
	quest.187DD7F87048F073.quest_subtitle: "Paint"
	quest.187DD7F87048F073.title: "&bColor Applicator&r"
