	quest.195CDF1B42271F2C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Generates&r a moderate amount of &6source&r from &6nearby food&r, generating more for more nourishing food. "
		""
		"&6Source Berry&r food is worth far more than other mundane foods. "
		""
		"Additionally, the &6Mycelial Sourcelink&r will convert Grass or Dirt in the 3x3 below it into Mycelium and will grow mushrooms around it given that the space is empty."
