	quest.1B0BBEC316737A20.quest_desc: ["The &bCrystalite Elytra is made through an infusion process.&r It requires an &6Elytra in the center Infusion Pedestal&r, an &6Amber Gem in the northern pedestal, Enchanted Membrane in the east, south and west pedestals, and Crystal Shards in the north-east, north-west, south-east and south-west pedestals.&r It takes 500 ticks to complete the infusion."]
