	quest.1B137E3F37308A05.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Terminal&r, allowing you to view and access the contents of your &6network's storage&r and request things from your &6autocrafting setup&r."
		""
		"The &bCrafting Terminal&r is similar to a &6regular terminal&r, with all the same settings and sections, but with an added crafting grid that will be &6automatically refilled from network storage&r. Be careful when shift-clicking the output!"
		""
		"You should upgrade your terminal into a &6crafting terminal&r ASAP."
