	quest.1B64213A26848D47.quest_desc: [
		"&bME Wireless Access Point&r allows wireless &6access via&r a &bWireless Terminal&r. Range and power usage is &6determined&r based on the number of &bWireless Booster&r installed."
		""
		"A network can have any number of &bWireless Access Points&r with any number of &bWireless Booster&r in &6each one&r, allowing you to optimize power usage and range by altering your setup."
		""
