	quest.1CA3AAAB7C3BBED7.quest_desc: [
		"&6AllTheModium&r ores can be found across &63 dimensions&r: "
		""
		"&6AllTheModium&r in Overworld, &aVibranium&r in BetterNether, and &dUnobtainium&r in BetterEnd, normally exposed to &6air&r."
		""
		"As you can see the Allthemodium in Overture has got a different progression."
		""
		"It goes far above &6Netherite&r, &6Warden&r and &6Ignitium Set&r and other similar sets, offering unparalleled durability and enchantability."
		""
		"Whether you are &6facing tough bosses&r in distant dimensions or surviving the harshest environments, &6AllTheModium&r gear ensures you are virtually indestructible."
		""
