	quest.1CA464CC7378CB5D.quest_subtitle: "Explorer's Compass is an item that allows you to locate structures anywhere in the world."
	quest.1CA464CC7378CB5D.title: "Let me take you to some beautiful places."
	quest.1CC03BFF1601FF6C.quest_desc: [
		"&bRedstone cards&r add &6redstone control&r, adding a &6toggle button in the device's GUI&r to swap between various redstone conditions."
		""
		"&bME Toggle Buss&r is a bus which functions similarly to &bFluix ME Glass Cable&r or other &6cables&r, but it &6allows its connection&r state to be toggled via &credstone&r. This allows you to cut off a section of a &bME Network&r."
		""
		"When &credstone signal&r supplied the part enables the connection, &bME Inverted Toggle Bus&r provides the reverse behavior by disabling the connection instead."
		""
		"Of note, toggling these may cause the network to reboot and recalculate the connected devices."
		""
		"They are cable subparts."
	]
	quest.1CC03BFF1601FF6C.quest_subtitle: "More redstone"
	quest.1CC03BFF1601FF6C.title: "&bMore Redstone please&r"
	quest.1CD2E3E9375C6F98.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.1D04D114391FD71E.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Annihilation Plane&r is a, &6block-breaking&r, &6cable-subpart component&r that breaks blocks placed directly in front of it and &6imports the drops into&r an &bME Network&r. "
		""
		"It requires a &6network channel to function&r and acts similarly to an in-world &bImport Bus&r. "
	]
