	quest.1D289FED65DB89D6.quest_desc: [
		"The Ender Guardian has 333 health points and 20 armor in total. &6During the fight, it uses deadly attacks. It will knock you into the air, charge at you, and summon Void Runes, which deal large amounts of damage.&r"
		""
		"&6When the Ender Guardian reaches half health, it will smash the ground, causing it, and you to fall to the level below.&r Once the fight is over, it will drop the ‘Gauntlet of the Guard’. When holding it, you can hold the right mouse button to suck nearby entities towards you."
	]
	quest.1D289FED65DB89D6.quest_subtitle: "I'm not gonna describe his attacks."
	quest.1D289FED65DB89D6.title: "&5I'm Not Afraid of You!&r"
	quest.1D62890BC165F8A1.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Jar&r that stores up to 100 potions. Potion can be removed by using an &6Empty Bottle&r, &6Potion Flask&r, or &6Arrows&r on the jar."
		""
