	quest.1DDF168FA97505F2.quest_desc: ["You can use Diamond Smith Hammer only to get Sword Head Tool. With the Netherite Hammer, you can get everything you want."]
	quest.1DDF168FA97505F2.quest_subtitle: "Same process."
	quest.1DDF168FA97505F2.title: "&bThird Upgrade: Aeternium!&r"
	quest.1DEF82908E2592DB.quest_subtitle: "Bring an empty bottle to take the blood."
	quest.1DEF82908E2592DB.title: "&6Do I...? I'll Do it Then&r"
	quest.1E06F8E7DA59822D.quest_desc: [
		"To use the &6Awakening Altar&r, you must first place it down in the world. Make sure the surrounding area is clear of obstructions. Then, you must place &6Awakening Pedestals&r and &6Essence Vessels&r around the &baltar&r. The altar will show ghost pedestals/vessels in the world, indicating where you must place them."
		""
		"Once your altar is set up, you can place items on the altar and pedestals by right-clicking on them with an item in hand. The same for the vessels, though they can hold up to 40 of an item."
		""
		"To &bactivate the altar&r you can do one of the following:"
		""
		"Provide the altar with a &cRedstone signal&r (ex. button, lever)"
		"&bRight-click&r on the altar with a &aWand&r."
	]
	quest.1E06F8E7DA59822D.quest_subtitle: "&6The Awakening Altar&r is the core component of the multi-block &bAwakening crafting structure&r. Along with &6Awakening Pedestals&r and &6Essence Vessels&r, the altar is mainly used to craft &6Awakened Supremium&r."
	quest.1E06F8E7DA59822D.title: "&6The Awakening Altar&r"
	quest.1E6EEA53A5C071AA.quest_desc: ["Seed of Chaos it can be obtained defeating various mobs like Bonescaller, Supreme Bonescaller, Fallen Chaos Knight and Spirit of Chaos. "]
	quest.1E6EEA53A5C071AA.quest_subtitle: "Read Description"
	quest.1E6EEA53A5C071AA.title: "&cSeed of Chaos&r"
	quest.1ED16ADB216EA762.quest_desc: [
		"&bProsperity Seed Base&r: Used to create resource crops for harvestable materials."
		"&6Soulium Seed Base&r: Used to create crops for mob drops."
	]
	quest.1ED16ADB216EA762.quest_subtitle: "&aSeed Bases&r are crafting components used to create &6Resource Seeds&r. There are two variants available:"
	quest.1ED16ADB216EA762.title: "&dTwo Variants!"
	quest.1F54E048E0209E7B.quest_subtitle: "feel free to do this task..."
	quest.1F54E048E0209E7B.title: "Yes, a Barrel. Yes."
	quest.1FAC50BE08B262F0.quest_desc: [
		"The &b4k ME Storage Component&r in AE2 is an &6intermediate-tier storage&r part used to &6craft 4k ME Storage Cells&r, capable of holding 4,096 bytes of data. "
		""
		"It can store up to &6508 stacks&r of a single item or &6260 stacks across 63 different item types&r. It requires a 1k component and &bcalculation processors&r to craft. "
	]
	quest.1FAC50BE08B262F0.quest_subtitle: "4K"
	quest.1FAC50BE08B262F0.title: "&b4K ME Storage Component&r"
	quest.1FACA4D53CEC5C03.quest_desc: ["Put in your main-/offhand to prevent dying if you fall in the void. It can be found in almost every BetterEnd structure. You can also craft without finding it."]
	quest.1FACA4D53CEC5C03.quest_subtitle: "Why this Totem is blue?"
	quest.1FACA4D53CEC5C03.title: "&bBring This Void Totem to Me!&r"
	quest.1FBE689A2987946A.quest_subtitle: "Put any Smith Hammer in the first slot and the Thallasium Ingot in the second slot. You will get a Thallasium Forged Plate or head tools pieces to combine with Leather Templates."
	quest.1FBE689A2987946A.title: "&bFirst Upgrade: Thallasium!&r"
	quest.1FE8CD8B0E569A80.quest_desc: [
		"This special and fantastic &dCrystal&r it can be obtained by performing a &6BetterEnd ritual&r?"
		""
		"I'm gonna call it &6Infusion Ritual&r tho, it doesn't seems too hard at all."
	]
	quest.1FE8CD8B0E569A80.quest_subtitle: "Most of them seems familar to me."
	quest.1FE8CD8B0E569A80.title: "&dThis Crystal is Familar to Me"
	quest.1FFB56646D0241A9.quest_subtitle: "Used to craft Ender Spells"
	quest.1FFB56646D0241A9.title: "&6Ender Pearl&r"
