	quest.2005ACA0200272E4.quest_subtitle: "Can be easily found in Snow biomes and make sure to use 4 Soul Stars to summon the Boss"
	quest.2005ACA0200272E4.title: "&bMagical Eye"
	quest.2032CEC964481BAC.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCovered Cable&r variant &6offers no gameplay benefits&r over its Fluix ME Glass Cable counterpart."
		""
		"Meanwhile the &bFluix ME Dense Covered Cable&r the higher capacity cable, &6can carry 32 channels&r unlike standard cable which can only carry 8, however &6it doesn't support buses&r so you must first step down from &6dense to a smaller cable&r before using buses or panels."
		""
		"Also, &6dense cables&r slightly &6override the shortest path&r behavior of channels, channels will take the shortest path to a dense cable and then the shortest path through that &6dense cable to a controller&r."
	]
	quest.2032CEC964481BAC.quest_subtitle: "they are needed for other works"
	quest.2032CEC964481BAC.title: "&bMore Fluix Cables!"
	quest.20A8CAEAA413EB22.quest_subtitle: "Connects all of the touching inventories into one. You need a Storage Terminal to access all of your items"
	quest.20A8CAEAA413EB22.title: "&6Inventory Connector!&r"
	quest.20F1BA0836D3BE7A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Tanks&r are storage blocks to store fluids. "
		""
		"The amount of fluid (mb) a fluid tank can store is based on its tier. "
		""
		"It will retain its inventory when broken. &6You may use a Mechanical Pipe that is set to Pull in order to extract the fluid out of the tank&r."
	]
	quest.215299B4E27E8BD0.quest_subtitle: "So... The Sword is much stronger?"
	quest.215299B4E27E8BD0.title: "&fAn Essential Upgrade to the &bPickaxe&f!"
	quest.217FD16629817AD5.quest_desc: ["The &6Energy Discharger is used to drain energy (FE) out of charged items and then store it to an internal buffer&r if then connected via cables to extract that stored power and re-using it again."]
	quest.218B2932DDF8D60F.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.21C188F02530CCBE.quest_subtitle: "this is my favorite set"
	quest.21C188F02530CCBE.title: "&6Archevoker Armor Set&r"
	quest.21CDD67DF0997605.quest_desc: ["The &6Atomic Disassembler&r is an all-in-one tool, essentially the ultimate, electronic version of the &6paxel&r."]
	quest.21CDD67DF0997605.title: "&bAtomic Disassembler&r"
	quest.21EA0A40F4718F9F.title: "&bMore Mechanical Pipes&r"
	quest.22181173E3C95DE3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Quantum Entangloporters&r do not directly transfer matter (besides items), as the tooltip suggests. "
		""
		"Instead, &6each channel is a storage of energy&r, gas, liquids and so on that all connected entangloporters access. "
		""
		"This has important bearing on its throughput: &6any channel can not transfer more than its maximum capacity per tick&r. "
		""
		"Therefore, for large-scale applications (such as a sodium-cooled Fission Reactor), it is still best to use the port-to-port connection method."
	]
	quest.22181173E3C95DE3.title: "&bQuantum Entangloporter&r"
	quest.221916A0A64E63C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bGrowth Accelerator&r massively &6accelerates the growth&r of certus or amethyst when placed adjacent to the budding block."
		""
		"It can also accelerate the growth of various plants."
		""
		"To &6power it manually&r, place a &bWooden Crank&r on the top or bottom and right-click it."
		""
		"It only connects to &6cables&r on its ends where the pink fluix greebles are."
	]
	quest.221916A0A64E63C2.quest_subtitle: "wuoh i can use this in mystical agriculture"
	quest.221916A0A64E63C2.title: "&bGrowth Accelerator&r"
	quest.224A336E9B9EC8C1.quest_desc: ["                     1800HP"]
	quest.224A336E9B9EC8C1.quest_subtitle: "Somewhere in BetterNether..."
	quest.224A336E9B9EC8C1.title: "&4Cursed Eye"
	quest.224B15414924F0A9.title: "&6Alchemist Supreme Armor Set&r"
	quest.22509B26C792983C.quest_desc: [
		"While bearing some similarity to &bFluix ME Covered Cable&r in appearance, they provide diagnostic function by visualizing the &6channel usage on the cables&r, the channels appear as lit colored lines that run along the black stripe on the cables giving you an understanding of how your channels are being used on your network. "
		""
		"For &6regular smart cables&r, the &6first four channels show as lines&r matching the color of the cable, the next four show as white lines. "
		""
		"For &6dense&r smart cable, each stripe &6represents 4 channels&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"On networks with a &bME Controller&r, the lines on the cables &6show the exact path the channels take&r."
		""
		"&bSmart cables&r on ad-hoc networks will instead show the number of channels in use network-wide instead of the number of channels flowing through that specific cable."
		""
		"These can also be colored in the same manner as &bFluix ME Glass Cable&r."
	]
	quest.22509B26C792983C.quest_subtitle: "I really need these."
	quest.22509B26C792983C.title: "&bOther Cables!&r"
	quest.22B5FE1A2E85047E.title: "&bIce Dragonsteel Armor Set&r"
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.quest_desc: ["You enter in the Ancient Factory and &6be sure to bring with you the Nether Star to summon The Harbinger.&r"]
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.quest_subtitle: "Why do I need a Nether Star?"
	quest.22B82437318CDDF4.title: "&6Summoning Another Monster&r"
