	quest.25286CEA41F7010B.title: "&6Better than Gold&r"
	quest.25D82DF68817949C.quest_desc: [
		"The &b16k ME Storage Component&r in AE2 is a &6mid-tier digital storage component&r that holds 16,384 bytes of data, allowing for up to &663 different item types&r and a total of &62,032 stacks of a single item&r. "
		""
		"It is crafted using &64k components&r and is essential for creating 16k or &664k storage cells&r. "
	]
	quest.25D82DF68817949C.quest_subtitle: "16K"
	quest.25D82DF68817949C.title: "&b16K ME Storage Component&r"
	quest.2601A6DC6F8806F8.quest_subtitle: "The Brass Hand lets you to craft some important components."
	quest.2601A6DC6F8806F8.title: "&6&lAn Important Hand&r"
	quest.26077F6E51CB2D95.quest_subtitle: "This Weapon has got 2 different attacks."
	quest.26077F6E51CB2D95.title: "&6Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon&r"
	quest.262BB0FE0B3AD949.quest_subtitle: "Ice Bucket Challenge right?"
	quest.262BB0FE0B3AD949.title: "Woow this is gonna be funny!"
	quest.264E9C050C4A124A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Seed Reprocessor&r requires energy to function. You can either provide energy via any Forge Energy compatible energy transfer, or use the internal solid-fuel based generator."
		""
		"The machine can be upgraded using &6Machine Upgrades&r for faster operation and increased internal energy storage."
	]
	quest.264E9C050C4A124A.quest_subtitle: "The &6Seed Reprocessor&r is a machine built for converting extra seeds into essences."
	quest.26B27426D91E1157.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.2707500ACA2DD252.quest_subtitle: "it's not the classic nether fortress we all know."
	quest.2707500ACA2DD252.title: "&6Better Fortress!&r"
	quest.2709AFBEC3C26996.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMatter Condenser&r can be used as either a &6trash&r can or to create &bMatter Balls&r and &bsingularities&r. "
		""
		"It can take any item or fluid or etc. a &6storage cell&r can store."
	]
	quest.2709AFBEC3C26996.quest_subtitle: "Matter stuff"
	quest.2709AFBEC3C26996.title: "&bMatter: Condenser and Ball&r"
	quest.27766CC968ED8D32.quest_subtitle: "Tier 5"
	quest.27CCA0E7D5AB8D79.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Drive&r is the device you plug your &6storage cells&r into in order to use them for &6network storage&r. It has &610 slots&r which each accept a cell."
		""
		"If for some reason you want to, you can push and pull the &6cells from its inventory&r with any item logistics like hoppers or &bAE2 busses&r."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a &6Certus Quartz Wrench&r."
		""
		"The &bME Chest&r acts like a &6miniature network&r with a ME Terminal, ME Drive, and Energy Acceptor. While it can be used as a &6tiny storage network&r, its capacity for just one single storage cell means it has limited utility as such."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Instead, it is useful for interacting with specifically the &6storage cell&r mounted inside it. Its integrated terminal can only see and access the items in the mounted drive, while devices on the general network can access items in any network storage, &6including ME chests&r."
		""
		"It has 2 different GUIs and is sided for item transport. Interacting with the top &6terminal opens&r the integrated terminal. Items can be inserted into the mounted storage cell through this face, but not extracted. Interacting with any other face opens the GUI with the slot for the &bstorage cell&r and the priority settings. The cell can be inserted and removed by item logistics only through the face with the cell slot."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It can be rotated with a &6Certus Quartz Wrench&r."
		""
		"It has a small &bAE energy storage buffer&r, so if not on a network with an &6energy cell&r, inserting or extracting too many items at once may cause it to brown out."
	]
	quest.27CCA0E7D5AB8D79.quest_subtitle: "Long description, I know..."
	quest.27CCA0E7D5AB8D79.title: "&bME Drive/Chest&r"
	quest.27F8367E5B1844FD.quest_subtitle: "Polished Rose Quartz is an important crafting material used in the production of Electron Tubes. "
	quest.27F8367E5B1844FD.title: "&dPolished Rose Quartz&r"
	quest.2840599362653C46.quest_desc: ["&6This machine&r it is used to create &6HDPE Pellets&r by also creating its intermediate component, substrate. Its sides can be configured to import or export materials."]
	quest.2840599362653C46.title: "&bPressurized Reaction Chamber&r"
	quest.285B2D9707E223AE.quest_desc: ["Used to craft &delite armor&r and &dtools&r with enhanced stats and 2 &bAugment slots&r. Created in an &6Awakening Altar&r, it requires combining a block of &4Supremium Essence&r with 4 &6Cognizant Dust&r and 10 of each elemental essence (air, earth, fire, water)."]
	quest.285B2D9707E223AE.quest_subtitle: "&6 Awakened Supremium&r is the &bhighest-tier&r, &bendgame&r material"
	quest.285B2D9707E223AE.title: "&6Awakened Supremium Essence&r"
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Portable Storage Interfaces are used on Contraptions.&r"
		""
		"&6For Portable Storage Interfaces to interact they must face each other at 1 to 2 blocks apart.&r One interface must be on a Contraption, while the other is stationary."
	]
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.quest_subtitle: "The Portable Storage Interface is used to allows Item Transporters to directly interact with Contraption inventories."
	quest.2890FDE7FED2B18D.title: "&6Portable Storage Interface&r"
	quest.28BFF65CA94FF2E5.quest_desc: [
		"Ender Gate is &6used to transfer energy between the adjacent block&r and the ender network."
		""
		"Unlike the Ender Cell you can not upgrade the network from it."
	]
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gearbox can relay rotational power in four horizontal directions.&r "
		""
		"The vertical counterpart, like the normal version, &6can relay power in four vertical directions.&r"
		""
		"When receiving input from any input side (sides with a shaft shape), &6the Gearbox will output/relay rotational power in opposite spin for all of the remaining sides.&r "
		""
		"In another word, when the input is clockwise, the output on the other 3 sides will be anti-clockwise, and vice-versa."
	]
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.quest_subtitle: "The Gearbox is a block used to transfer Rotational power in 4 directions, either horizontally or vertically."
	quest.28F69A65F5864647.title: "&6Gearbox&r"
