	quest.29B0B654E875E342.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Storage Bus&r is a crucial device that &6connects external inventories&r (chests, barrels, drawers) directly to an &bME Network&r, allowing them to function as part of the &6system's storage&r. "
		""
