	quest.2F5FD3CE365D8EF0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Imbues&r certain items with &6Source&r to create new items. "
		""
		"The primary way to obtain &6Source Gems&r, amethyst and &6lapis&r may be used to create &6Source Gems&r."
		""
		"The &6Imbuement Chamber&r will passively accumulate source for recipes, or will draw from &6Source Jars&r 2 block away. "
		""
		"Some recipes require additional items placed in &6pedestals&r within 1 block of the &6Imbuement Chamber&r, such as Essences. "
		""
		"Items in &6pedestals&r will not be consumed."
	]
