	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Maledictus is characterized by rapid health regeneration and devastating attacks.&r Key attacks include massive phantom sword slashes, summoning swirling phantom halberds, powerful leaping ground slams, and &6a one-shot grapple move that can destroy heavily armored players.&r"
		""
		"&6Phantom Halberd Spiral: Maledictus summons multiple phantom halberds that rotate in a spiral pattern around the battlefield&r, dealing damage to any players caught in their path."
		""
		"&6Grapple/Throw Attack: A highly dangerous attack where the boss traps the player and, in some instances, throws them into the air&r, capable of one-shotting players."
		""
		"&6Leaping Slam: Maledictus frequently leaps into the air and crashes down.&r"
		""
		"&6Spectral Projectiles: Maledictus can fire phantom arrows or similar projectiles&r, often in bursts."
		""
		"&6High-Speed Regeneration: If not constantly damaged, Maledictus regenerates health rapidly&r, making him nearly impossible to defeat without high-damage output."
	]
	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.quest_subtitle: "You will not defeat me."
	quest.30E96481ED2F9D5E.title: "&bHave Fun with Maledictus!&r"
	quest.31146C25B0AF758D.quest_desc: ["&bUnbreakable crafting tool&r, providing unlimited uses for &bupgrading essence tiers&r (e.g., &aInferium&r to &2Prudentium&r).It acts as a universal catalyst, replacing lower-tier crystals in autocrafting systems like &6Applied Energistics 2&r."]
	quest.31146C25B0AF758D.quest_subtitle: "&cThe Master Infusion Crystal&r is the &bhighest-tier&r."
