	quest.36527B5DC7BDA86A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack can be filled up wherever Hydrogen gas is outputted into a slot&r. "
		""
		"Here are a few examples:"
		""
		"It can be placed in the &6Electrolytic Separator&r's left output slot (where Hydrogen is outputted) after placing water in the machine's input slot (which will result in the machine creating Hydrogen)."
		""
		"It can be placed in a &6Gas Tank&r's (that has been placed on the ground) output slot."
	]
