	quest.3991D006ED828F01.title: "&fOsmium Between Your Hands&r"
	quest.39B4E6DC4F5D1F93.title: "&6Common Ink&r"
	quest.39C3D3275C603406.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.39C3F9F4BEB5CDD2.quest_desc: [
		"I remember that the &dCreative Essence&r was intended only for &6Allthemodium Alloy&r weapons but it's not."
		""
		"Also, where is the &4Deep Void&r? The &4Apostle&r... The &4Weaver of Souls&r...? I don't know."
