	quest.3AA203E1DCA23DA6.quest_desc: ["The &6Unattuned Augment&r is typically combined with essences of a certain tier (e.g., &aInferium&r, &4Supremium&r) and other items to produce a tuned augment with a specific effect."]
	quest.3AA203E1DCA23DA6.quest_subtitle: "The &6Unattuned Augment&r is a base item used as a crafting ingredient for specific augments, rather than an augment with a description or function on its own."
	quest.3AA203E1DCA23DA6.title: "&6Unattuned Augment&r"
	quest.3ABD4976B120C66D.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Harbinger has 390 health and 12 armor. When it fights, it switches between missile, rocket, and laser modes.&r These are easy to counter, provided you have a Shield and some Fire Resistance, as these attacks will set you on fire."
		""
		"&6These attacks may also hit you with the ‘Wither’ effect, so bring plenty of food. If you think it could be helpful, bring buckets of milk to remove any negative debuffs.&r Every so often, the Harbinger will use a new (and powerful) ability, the Death Laser."
	]
	quest.3ABD4976B120C66D.quest_subtitle: "I will defeat you. Just Wait."
	quest.3ABD4976B120C66D.title: "&6Show Me What You Got!&r"
	quest.3AF8F383AFAD4E47.quest_desc: [
		"&bInverter Cards&r swap filters in &6devices and tools&r from whitelist to blacklist."
		""
		"&bFuzzy Cards&r let &6devices and tools&r with filters filter by damage level and/or ignore item NBT, &6allowing you to export&r all iron axes no matter the damage level and enchantments, or only export damaged diamond swords, not fully repaired ones."
	]
	quest.3AF8F383AFAD4E47.quest_subtitle: "other cards"
	quest.3AF8F383AFAD4E47.title: "&bA lot of Cards!&r"
	quest.3AF9429A4B8BFC72.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Energy Cell is used to store energy&r."
		""
		"Can also be used to add capacity to an &6Ender Network channel by Shift-cliking&r it to an &6Ender Cell GUI&r, if the &6Energy Cell&r contains energy then will also be applied to the ender network channel."
	]
	quest.3B309F1BE4F18DC7.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.3B478F28D62E7303.title: "&6Ruined Book&r"
	quest.3B6844824FAE37D7.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Gas-Burning Generator&r is used to burn flammable gases like Hydrogen to produce energy."
		""
		"The &6Generator needs flammable gases&r (e.g., Hydrogen) to produce energy, which can be supplied manually via storage items, like the &6Basic Gas Tank&r or through &6Basic Pressurized Pipes&r."
	]
	quest.3B6844824FAE37D7.title: "&bGas-Burning Generator&r"
	quest.3B6BF03C9E7A369D.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Soul Extractor&r requires energy to function. You can either provide energy via any &bForge Energy&r compatible energy transfer, or use the internal solid-fuel based generator."
		""
		"Place a valid &6Soul Extractor&r input item in the left slot, and a &6Soul Jar&r in the right slot. &6The machine&r will convert those items into &bMob Souls&r and insert them into the &6Soul Jar&r until it is full."
		""
		"The &6machine&r can be upgraded using &aMachine Upgrades&r for faster operation and increased internal energy storage."
	]
	quest.3B6BF03C9E7A369D.quest_subtitle: "The &6Soul Extractor&r is a machine used for extracting &bMob Souls&r from items into &6Soul Jars&r."
	quest.3B842BD323643063.quest_desc: ["&6Amber Gems are required items to make rituals.&r"]
	quest.3B842BD323643063.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in Amber Lands biome."
	quest.3B842BD323643063.title: "&6Ohh This Gem looks interesting!&r"
	quest.3BA1A05E5DE307ED.quest_desc: [
		"When you approach to the dungeon, you have to defeat &6other Valkyries&r. "
		""
		"They will drop &6victory medals&r that you must collect and bring to the &6Valkyrie Queen&r; otherwise, you won't be able to face her."
	]
	quest.3BA1A05E5DE307ED.quest_subtitle: "Find the Silver Dungeon and defeat the Valkyrie Queen!"
