	quest.3D44203529AA9AD1.quest_desc: [
		"This machine is &6used to separate fluids&r into their component elements."
		""
		"It is used to separate Heavy Water into &6Deuterium&r and &6Oxygen&r, &6Brine&r into Sodium and &6Chlorine&r, and Water into Hydrogen and Oxygen. The products are used by the Mekanism Ore-Processing system."
		""
		"&6Insertion and extraction&r of materials &6can be done by buckets&r or a pipe system. "
		""
		"The two side faces are reserved for product extraction. "
		""
		"For example, when separating Water, &6hydrogen&r and &6oxygen&r are extracted through the left and right sides respectively."
		""
		"If at least one of the internal product storage buffers is full and no product is removed, the machine stops working. If only one product is needed, use the \"dumping\" options"
	]
	quest.3D44203529AA9AD1.title: "&bElectrolytic Separator&r"
	quest.3D7F3DBDFE2199A4.quest_desc: [
		"&6The first Mini-Boss that defends the Ruined Citadel is the Ender Golem. At least two can be found, one on the main floor and one below the structure.&r These have 150 health points and 12 armor."
		""
		"&6Defeating them rewards the Void Core, which can be used to summon damaging Void Runes, which can help fight the Ender Guardian.&r To reach the Ender Guardian, you must go two levels deeper than the main Ruined Citadel structure. "
		""
		"Specifically, the &6Ender Guardian is located directly below the Ender Golem.&r"
	]
	quest.3D7F3DBDFE2199A4.quest_subtitle: "Be careful..."
	quest.3D7F3DBDFE2199A4.title: "&5Another Stronghold?&r"
	quest.3D8F9E74DC306D14.quest_desc: [
		"The &bNetwork Tool&r is a &6modified wrench&r that also shows network diagnostic information and &6can store upgrade cards&r. While it retains the wrench's ability to quickly disassemble things and pull subparts off of a &6cable&r, it cannot rotate things."
		""
		"It has &69 slots&r in which to &6store upgrade cards&r, and they will be available in any &bAE2 device UI&r if the tool is anywhere in your inventory."
		""
		"&6Right-clicking&r any part of a network will show a diagnostic info window, similar to &6right-clicking a ME Controller&r."
	]
	quest.3D8F9E74DC306D14.quest_subtitle: "Is this the definitive wrench?"
	quest.3D8F9E74DC306D14.title: "&bNetwork Tool&r"
	quest.3D9BB3778B25B971.title: "&aGeomancer Armor Set"
