	quest.3ED99C3B85068B50.quest_subtitle: "The Sunken City..."
	quest.3ED99C3B85068B50.title: "&9Guardian Eye"
	quest.3EFEADBFA54E9421.quest_desc: ["&6The Ancient Remnant is one of the most formidable bosses.&r It embodies the ancient power that once ruled the desert sands. This skeletal behemoth resembles a massive Spinosaurus and lies dormant at the heart of the pyramid’s inner sanctum until awakened by a brave adventurer wielding the Desert Necklace."]
	quest.3EFEADBFA54E9421.quest_subtitle: "I will Defeat You!"
	quest.3EFEADBFA54E9421.title: "&6I Was Waiting You!&r"
	quest.3F157A94AFBE3D8E.quest_desc: ["Primarily used to craft &bhigh-level seeds&r, &dindestructible tools&r, and &dpowerful armor&r. It is essential for &6endgame&r, enabling the creation of &bSupreme-tier&r items, including &6Awakened Supremium&r."]
	quest.3F157A94AFBE3D8E.quest_subtitle: "&4Supremium Essence&r is a &6Tier 5&r, &5top-tier magical resource&r"
	quest.3F157A94AFBE3D8E.title: "&4Supremium Essence&r"
	quest.3F22C186AC8E44F5.quest_subtitle: "Tier 5"
	quest.3F23C0A3FFA7700E.quest_desc: [
		"This machine &6grinds solid materials into dusts&r. However, it doesn't double ores. "
		""
		"It is used primarily for two tasks: producing &6Bio Fuel&r and being an important part of the tier 2, 3 and 4 ore-processing system."
	]
	quest.3F23C0A3FFA7700E.title: "&bCrusher&r"
	quest.3F3426222B4D3864.title: "&bMore Chemical Tanks&r"
	quest.3F38E3A1A0D2D194.quest_desc: [
		"&bWireless terminals&r are &6portable versions&r of the regular &bWired Terminals&r. They have the exact same UIs as their wired counterparts, except instead of slots for &6View Cells&r, they have slots for &6upgrade cards&r."
		""
		"In order to pair them with a network, &6insert the terminal in the top-right slot&r of a &bME Wireless Access Point&r connected to that &6network&r."
		""
		"They must be within range of a &bME Wireless Access Point&r to function."
		""
		"Their energy can be &6recharged&r in a &bCharger&r."
	]
	quest.3F38E3A1A0D2D194.quest_subtitle: "So I can go everywhere with these wireless?"
	quest.3F38E3A1A0D2D194.title: "&bWireless! Don't forgot to charge it&r"
