	quest.41564073E0585D52.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze Burners must have Blazes in them to function.&r "
		""
		"&6To put a Blaze in an Empty Blaze Burner, right-click on a Blaze while holding an Empty Blaze Burner. Alternatively,&r an Empty Blaze Burner can be filled by right-clicking on a Blaze Spawner."
		""
		"&6Blaze Burners are used for Heating and Super-Heating Basins when doing Mixing recipes. &r"
		""
		"In particular, &6they are required to make Brass.&r They can also be used as a heat source for boilers &6used to power Steam Engines.&r "
		""
		"When a heat-able block is placed above a fueled Blaze Burner, the Burner will appear to channel heat into the block."
	]
	quest.41564073E0585D52.quest_subtitle: "A Blaze Burner is a heating component that is required for certain Mixing recipes."
	quest.41564073E0585D52.title: "&6&lWhere Blazes Works!&r"
	quest.418116AFD933D3C5.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEnergizing Orb&r is used to energize items- We already know that... but require at least one &6Energizing Rod in range of 9x9 to work&r, the energizing speed depends on amount of rods and the rod tier (I/0 rate)."
		""
		"The orb doesn't require energy but the rods must be placed on cables or any &6Forge Energy (FE)&r block to work."
		""
		"&6When you're placing the orb/rod in range will automatically link to each other&r, also you can use the Wrench I gave you in the first Quest, and use the &aWrench&r with Link mode to re-link them."
	]
	quest.418116AFD933D3C5.quest_subtitle: "Let me know if you like reading :D"
	quest.418116AFD933D3C5.title: "&fYou Need More&r &aMaterials!&r"
	quest.4189AA7BAD627B41.quest_subtitle: "Tier 4"
	quest.41A11876EEA3C2A9.quest_desc: ["&6Chemical Tanks&r are used to store Gases. They can be placed as a block and can interact with &6Pressurized Tubes&r. They come in the four tiers, each tier being double the capacity and output rate of its predecessor. It can store the following gases:"]
	quest.41BAF3A6D3028882.quest_subtitle: "This is a special Bow."
