	quest.4440AB354CB53D11.quest_subtitle: "It's good, but you can do better than you think."
	quest.4440AB354CB53D11.title: "&6First Tier: AllTheModium!&r"
	quest.444AE591FCCD020B.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &44 Supremium Essence&r and an &bInfusion Crystal&r. It is used to create &btop-tier items&r, including &6Nether Star Seeds&r, &6Dragon Egg Seeds&r, Insanium Coal/Ingots/Blocks, and &dInsanium Farmland&r."]
