	quest.4478B51E835A2DA9.title: "&6Dragonskin Spell Book&r"
	quest.4496AFA52F2EE9F5.quest_desc: [
		"The &b64k ME Storage Component&r is the &6highest-tier item storage component&r in AE2, used to craft the &664k ME Storage Cell&r. "
		""
		"It provides 65,536 bytes of storage, &6capable of holding 8,128 stacks&r of a &6single item&r or &64,160 stacks across 63 different types&r."
	]
	quest.4496AFA52F2EE9F5.quest_subtitle: "64K"
	quest.4496AFA52F2EE9F5.title: "&b64K ME Storage Component&r"
	quest.457FF44B143922D9.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Netherite Monstrosity remains inactive until players come close enough to activate it.&r Once awakened, the Monstrosity turns aggressive and starts its devastating attack patterns, flooding the arena with dangerous lava and fire-based assaults."
		""
		"&6Melee Attacks:&r "
		"&6There are multiple melee attacks that the Netherite Monstrosity will do.&r Firstly, when the player is nearby, the Netherite Monstrosity will slam the ground, dealing a high amount of damage."
		""
		"&6Ranged Attacks:&r"
		"&6When at a distance, the Netherite Monstrosity will favor more range-based attacks instead.&r A particularly dangerous ability called Lava Eruption sees the boss spray four Lava Bombs from its mouth in rapid succession. These summon lava on contact with the ground."
	]
	quest.457FF44B143922D9.quest_subtitle: "He doesn't want you."
	quest.457FF44B143922D9.title: "&6You Seemed Friendly...&r"
	quest.4594461C87E9DACC.quest_subtitle: "Tier 5"
	quest.459868474B3DEF85.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1"
	quest.459D981588390621.quest_desc: ["The &6Thermo Generator is another FE generator that generates energy&r when placed on top of a high tempo block/fluid like lava, require a coolant fluid like water to run."]
	quest.45FA7C0FD435CB00.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCharged Staff&r is an energy-powered melee weapon crafted from 2 Iron Ingots and 1 &bCharged Certus Quartz Crystal&r. "
		""
		"It holds 8,000 AE, consumes 300 AE per attack, and &6can be recharged&r in a &bCharger&r. "
	]
	quest.45FA7C0FD435CB00.quest_subtitle: "oh cool"
	quest.45FA7C0FD435CB00.title: "&bCharged Staff&r"
	quest.460C1E8C01617ADE.quest_desc: ["This is needed to &6charge items when is in player inventory&r, can also be used to upgrade channel by shift-clicking a Battery to an &6Ender Cell GUI&r, if the &aBattery&r contain energy then will also be applied to the ender network channel."]
