	]
	quest.46F8B4AFF0B06782.quest_desc: ["The &6Solar Panel is an FE generator that generates energy when exposed to sunlight&r, obviously high tiers generates more FE/t, any block that stop light above the Solar panel will stop its production."]
	quest.4706CB3C68BD9015.title: "&6Tablet of Challenge&r"
	quest.4728DF07ADDB12A6.quest_desc: ["To &5enchant&r an item, place it in the &b3rd slot&r. Then, place enough of the required items into the first or second slots. Each level of the enchantment will require &6additional items&r."]
	quest.4728DF07ADDB12A6.quest_subtitle: "&5The Enchanter&r is a block that can apply enchantments to books, tools or armor using items and essences."
