	quest.48673963DE8AD0AB.title: "&bSecond Tier: Vibranium!&r"
	quest.4877A0A0EEC45994.quest_subtitle: "To craft Andesite Casing, place any Stripped Log and right-click with a piece of Andesite Alloy."
	quest.4877A0A0EEC45994.title: "&l&6I Like Create!&r"
	quest.487EE4F794EFD742.quest_subtitle: "Dragon horns can be used to store dragons. Right-click onto your Tamed Dragon with a Dragon Horn in your hand and they will be stored inside, they can be summoned back by holding down right-click. Dragons do not grow up while in a dragon horn."
	quest.487EE4F794EFD742.title: "&6Stay With Me!&r"
	quest.488735EAE7F8DB69.quest_desc: [
		"&dEternal Crystal is crafted through an infusion ritual using an Infusion Pedestal and eight surrounding pedestals&r, requiring 1 End Crystal, 4 Crystal Shards, and 4 Ender Shards. &6Activated by right-clicking&r, the 12.5-second ritual fuses these items to create the &dcrystal, which is essential for powering Eternal Portals.&r"
