	quest.4928F99F37B72791.title: "&dEther Crystal&r"
	quest.494F7E6C23B14E83.quest_desc: ["The shaft is a basic mechanical component and &6can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other&r, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which Mechanical Belts can be placed."]
