	quest.4B413E6EEB66F844.quest_desc: [
		"The player can set the &6mining radius and the depth for its scanning area&r."
		""
		"The player can also opt to replace all mined blocks should the player wish to do so by keeping it fed with the desired material. "
		""
		"The &6Digital Miner&r can be configured to mine ores only within a certain area. "
		""
		"The &6Digital Miner&r can also be set to silk touch ores, but this results in higher power consumption. Like all other Mekanism machines, the &6Digital Miner&r can automatically remove ores from its inventory for automated processing by other machines. It also takes the same upgrades as other &6Mekanism machines&r. It is also known that placing a &6Digital Miner&r in a claim (claims on servers) will stop it from working."
	]
	quest.4B413E6EEB66F844.title: "&bDigital Miner&r"
