	quest.4F4BBD182D5F9DF9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Mechanical Pipe&r transports liquids between storage blocks and machines. "
		""
		"&6It is the tier 1 of liquid transport pipes&r provided by &bMekanism&r, with the lowest capacity of 1000 mB and pump rate of 100 mB/s. "
		""
		"Note: This type of pipe only transports liquids; for gases there are the pressurized tubes. It is also used as a component to craft the next tier of liquid transport pipes, the &6Advanced Mechanical Pipe&r."
	]
	quest.4F4F8BF67F80B335.quest_desc: [
		"An &bAE2 network&r needs to be &6chunkloaded&r for any of its devices to be able to &6function&r, and if only some of it is &6loaded&r, it may not function correctly. The &bSpatial Anchor&r solves this problem. It &6forceloads the chunks&r that its network occupies. A single &6cable&r extending across a &6chunk border&r is enough to load that new chunk."
		""
		"It will propagate its \"loading\" across &bquantum bridges&r, but &6not cross-dimensionally&r, so if you have a quantum bridge to the nether, you need a &bSpatial Anchor&r on the network in your &6base&r and on the network in the nether."
		""
		"By default it will also enable random ticks in its &6loaded chunks&r, this can be turned off in the &bAE2 config&r."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a &bCertus Quartz Wrench&r if for some reason you want to do that."
	]
	quest.4F4F8BF67F80B335.quest_subtitle: "good luck with the recipe"
	quest.4F4F8BF67F80B335.title: "&bSpatial Anchor&r"
	quest.4F7AD8348B7BF5DA.quest_desc: ["They are surely &6affected by looting&r but what if they doesn't gonna give me the discs? I'll see what I can do."]
