	quest.4FEA69F2E146F1E6.quest_desc: [
		"A &bBlank Pattern&r in AE2 is an essential item used &6to store&r crafting or processing recipes for &6automation&r. Encoded via an &bME Pattern Terminal&r, it is transformed into a &bCrafting&r or &bProcessing Pattern&r, which is then inserted into &bME Pattern Providers&r or &bMolecular Assemblers&r to enable autocrafting."
		""
		"The &bME Pattern Encoding Terminal&r in AE2 is a &6specialized terminal&r that allows users to create, edit, and manage crafting and processing recipes (Patterns) for automation directly within an &bME Network&r. It features a &63x3 grid for designing recipes&r, a slot for &bblank patterns&r, and toggleable modes for &6standard crafting&r or &6machine processing&r. "
	]
