	quest.541179D5310D9719.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Controller&r is the routing hub of a &6ME Network&r. Without it, a network is \"ad-hoc\" and can only have a max of &68 channel-using devices total&r."
		""
		"It is not possible to have 2 controllers in one &6ME Network&r."
		""
		"The controller provides &b32 Channels&r per face."
		""
		"The &bME Controller&r requires 6 AE/t per controller block to function. Each &6controller block can store 8000 AE&r, so larger networks might require additional energy storage. See energy for details."
		""
		"&6Multiblock Controllers&r can be built in a fairly &6free form&r."
	]
