	quest.572FC045DE0F8B23.quest_desc: ["Place a compatible &dtool&r or &darmor&r piece into the &bcenter slot of the GUI&r. On the right, 1 or more slots will be unlocked. There you can place any applicable &6Augment&r. Remove the tool from the center slot and the &6Augment&r will have been applied. You can remove &6Augments&r at any time by placing the tool or armor piece back into the center slot and taking out the &6Augment&r."]
