	quest.60ECCBBFF31A2A25.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDimension Card&r allows wireless &6access&r to an &bME Network&r from any &6dimension&r. Placed in a &bWireless Terminal&r, it works in &6conjunction&r with an &bInfinity Booster&r in a &bWireless Access Point&r to provide &6cross-dimensional connectivity&r. "
		""
		"The &bInfinity Range Booster&r when installed in an &bME Wireless Access Point&r, removes range restrictions, allowing &6wireless access&r to your network from anywhere within the same &6dimension&r. It typically costs 3 Netherite ingots and a Nether Star to craft. "
	]
