	quest.6323D5FF8FA2738C.quest_desc: [
		"In &bAE2&r, a &bSingularity&r is an &6advanced, high-tier crafting component&r used primarily for &6endgame technology&r, most notably to create &bQuantum Entangled Singularities&r for linking &bME Quantum Bridges&r. "
