	quest.63A05A4818CC82AD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Solar Generator&r harnesses sunlight to create power. The generator &6is particularly useful for generating passive energy&r for above-ground machines instead of draining &6your main stores&r."
		""
		"While active, it will output 1200 J/sec (60 J/t) through the bottom of the panel base. It has a small 96 kJ internal power buffer. This &6Solar Generator&r's low output limits its usefulness, but that isn't the case with its larger cousin, the &6Advanced Solar Generator&r."
	]
