	quest.64783C86F3955DDD.quest_desc: [
		"&bCrafting CPUs&r manage &6crafting requests/jobs&r. They store the intermediate ingredients while &6crafting jobs with multiple steps&r are being carried out, and affect how big jobs can be, and to some degree how fast they are completed. See autocrafting for &6more details&r."
		""
		"&6Each crafting&r CPU handles &61 request or job&r, so if you want to request both a calculation processor and &6256 smooth stone&r at once, you need 2 CPU multiblocks."
		""
		"They can be set to handle requests from players, automation (export busses and interfaces), or both."
		""
		"Right-clicking one brings up a crafting status UI where you can check the progress on the crafting job the CPU is handling."
	]
	quest.64783C86F3955DDD.quest_subtitle: "I'll be generous with crafting unit..."
	quest.64783C86F3955DDD.title: "&bCrafting Storage&r"
