	quest.64CECB5B56EE608D.quest_subtitle: "This time is gonna be fun"
	quest.64CECB5B56EE608D.title: "&bSome Keybinds and New Progression&r"
	quest.64DF6319771A9B95.title: "&bMore Logistical Transporters&r"
	quest.64E0BFAFF854A7EC.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Generator needs combustible materials&r (e.g., Coal or Lava) to produce energy. Lava can be supplied manually via storage items like the &6Basic Gas Tank&r or through &6Basic Fluid Pipes&r."
		""
		"&6The Generator can produce energy passively from adjacent Lava blocks&r. So this mode the generator produces smaller quantities of energy compared to consuming combustibles but can produce energy constantly without consuming materials. "
		""
		"&6Every block of Lava&r next to the generator raises the heat input and subsequently energy production."
	]
	quest.64E0BFAFF854A7EC.title: "&bFirst Functional Block!&r"
	quest.64E23DB395B742DA.quest_subtitle: "Simple, get netherite ingots and craft these."
	quest.64E23DB395B742DA.title: "&bNetherite ingot what?&r"
	quest.64E65BB04102C806.quest_desc: ["&6When placed on the back of a Mechanical Piston, the Piston Extension Pole will increase the maximum distance the piston can extend.&r Without a Piston Extension Pole, a Mechanical Piston will not extend at all. Additional poles will not increase the stress impact of the piston."]
	quest.64E65BB04102C806.quest_subtitle: "The Piston Extension Pole is an extension for Mechanical Pistons"
	quest.64E65BB04102C806.title: "&6Piston Extension Pole&r"
	quest.6519602881CC639C.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in Swamp biomes."
