	quest.6A3D90ED56FA710D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Born In Chaos introduces varied monsters like the Nightmare Stalker, Missionaries, Scarlet Persecutors, and various zombies/skeletons.&r"
		""
		"This mod &6encourages a tactical approach to combat, particularly with the introduction of dangerous mini-bosses&r that appear after the 10th day."
