	quest.6A5C8C269794BB69.quest_desc: ["Crafted using &3Imperium essence&r, this farmland accelerates crop growth and provides a significantly higher output of essence compared to lower tiers like &aInferium&r or &2Prudentium&r. It is essential for automating large-scale production of high-value resources."]
	quest.6A5C8C269794BB69.quest_subtitle: "&3Imperium Farmland&r is a &bhigh-tier&r growth medium used to maximize the yield of &bresource-producing crops&r."
