	quest.6E1F956F7C98771F.quest_subtitle: "&6Machine Frame&r blocks are so much important!"
	quest.6E20A33094625673.quest_desc: [
		"&6Encased chain drives may be placed side by side either vertically or horizontally to form a chain passing rotational power among all the blocks.&r "
		""
		"&6The blocks must touch on their sides&r (not axis to side) and &6be in a single straight line to form a chain. &r"
		""
		"The axes of the encased chain drives may be all parallel or blocks &6can be rotated to orient the axis perpendicularly. &r"
		""
		"&6Encased chain drives can also pass rotational power through their rotating axis&r, but this is not a continuation of the same chain."
	]
	quest.6E20A33094625673.quest_subtitle: "The Encased Chain Drive is a block that can transfer rotation much like the Mechanical Belt."
	quest.6E20A33094625673.title: "&6Encased Chain Drive&r"
