	quest.6E6B35E1F734B9F5.quest_desc: [
		"While in a &bplayers inventory&r, any &6Experience Orbs&r picked up by the player will automatically go into the &6Experience Capsule&r."
		""
		"Experience can be manually added from the &bplayer's Experience&r to the Capsule by &bright-clicking it&r. Experience can also be taken from the Capsule and added to the &bplayer's Experience by shift-right-clicking it&r."
	]
	quest.6E6B35E1F734B9F5.quest_subtitle: "The &6Experience Capsule&r is used to store experience points. It is mostly used to create &6Experience Seeds&r, but can also be used just as a way to hold experience."
	quest.6E6B35E1F734B9F5.title: "XP XP XP XP XP"
	quest.6EDFAD687802C6E2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Chemical Washer&r turns &6Slurry&r into &6Clean Slurry using Water&r. "
		""
		"The clean slurry then needs to be further refined by pumping it into a &6Chemical Crystallizer&r. "
		""
		"Note that unlike most &6Mekanism machines&r this one has fixed \"in\" and \"out\" sides for the mineral flow. \"In\" will be on the left when first placed and \"out\" is on the right. It can of course be rotated with the &6Configurator&r. Water is piped in through the top of the machine."
	]
	quest.6EDFAD687802C6E2.title: "&bChemical Washer&r"
	quest.6EFFC63F6050FE3B.title: "&6Pyromancer Armor Set"
	quest.6F2A653F290FCC25.quest_desc: [
		"&bBlue Star&r... I see, I never saw this &6Star&r before in any &6Universe&r but I need a lot of &6Allthemodium Alloy ingots&r."
		""
