	quest.6F2A653F290FCC25.quest_subtitle: "This will be my first Star ever made."
	quest.6F2A653F290FCC25.title: "&bWhat is This Star??"
	quest.6FAD8AD03BB7389E.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Interfaces must be placed facing each other at 1-2 blocks apart, one on a Contraption with Fluid Tanks and one stationary.&r A Fluid Pump is required to insert or extract liquid from the Contraption. To pump liquids to another tank, simply connect the stationary interface and the fluid tank with fluid pipes, although pumps are required to move the liquids."
		""
		"&6Contraptions will automatically stall for an Interface.&r A Redstone signal can be applied to break off the connection early."
	]
	quest.6FAD8AD03BB7389E.quest_subtitle: "The Portable Fluid Interface is the fluid version of the Portable Storage Interface."
