	quest.7338BECE9544C1E0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Scribe's Table&r is a crafting station used to learn new magic &6Glyphs&r and inscribe them onto &6items&r."
		""
		"To craft new glyphs, use a spell book on the &6table&r to open the codex and &6each glyph&r requires a set of items and experience points to &6unlock&r."
		""
		"Throw the &6items onto the table&r as rendered above, and the table will scribe a new &6glyph&r and will also pull items from nearby inventories. "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Also, you can use the &6Dominion Wand&r on the table will disable auto-pull."
		""
		"You may also &6inscribe&r a spell onto &6Spell Parchment&r or Enchanters Items..."
		""
		"To do this, place a &6Blank Parchment&r on the table. "
		""
		"Then, with your spell book in hand, &6change your spell&r book to your desired spell as if you were going to cast it. "
		""
		"Then, use the book on the table while &6sneaking&r. Your item will now contain that spell. Using &6Manipulation Essence&r will permanently &6hide&r the scribed spell."
	]
	quest.7338BECE9544C1E0.quest_subtitle: "Do you like Ars Nouveau?"
	quest.7338BECE9544C1E0.title: "&dAn Essential Table!"
