	quest.77F23196EEBE8A52.quest_desc: [
		"The Leviathan has over ten distinct attacks, categorized into basic abilities and more complex, devastating maneuvers. &6The basic attacks include Tentacle Smack, which involves the boss bending a random tentacle backward before thrusting it forward to deal 18 HP damage.&r"
		""
		"&6Another basic attack is Masticate, a brutal bite that tears the creature’s face open, delivering 32 HP damage and stunning the target for 5 seconds.&r These fundamental abilities form the foundation of the Leviathan’s combat repertoire and serve as setups for more dangerous combinations."
		""
		"&6The creature creates Abyssal Mines by hunching over, planting its tentacles, and roaring while shaking side to side.&r This process generates contact-triggered explosives that deal 5 HP damage and inflict Abyssal Fear for 10 seconds."
	]
	quest.77F23196EEBE8A52.quest_subtitle: "A Multidimensional Predator"
	quest.77F23196EEBE8A52.title: "&dBOOM LEVIATHAN!!"
	quest.783923AE33A8A8C4.quest_desc: [
		"&bEqual Distribution Cards&r can be applied to &6storage cells&r in a &6Cell Workbench&r and split the &6cell into equally-sized&r sections based on what the card is partitioned to. "
		""
