	quest.79AEFB6A44D93E41.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Soulium Spawner&r require energy to function. You can either provide energy via any &bForge Energy&r compatible energy transfer, or use the internal solid-fuel based generator."
		""
		"Place some essences in the input slot and provide power. After processing time has completed a mob will be spawned randomly in a 3 block radius around the spawner. &6The spawner&r can be upgraded with a &6Machine Upgrade&r to increase the operation speed."
		""
		"&6The spawner&r will not be able to spawn mobs if there are 32 or more entities of the type being spawned within its spawn radius."
	]
	quest.79AEFB6A44D93E41.quest_subtitle: "The &6Soulium Spawner&r is a machine that uses &bMob Essences&r to spawn mobs."
