	quest.7C55801AA03D88FD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Magmator is an FE generator that generates energy from high tempo fluids&r like Lava."
		""
		"High tiers of Magmator generate more FE/t and it has higher energy output, also they burn the fuel faster with the same energy gained per fuel tick."
	]
	quest.7C68F09E53916A1B.title: "&6Pyromancer Armor Set&r"
	quest.7CEB1E3768787104.quest_desc: ["The &6Player Transmitter is used to charge items wirelessly in linked player inventory&r including armor slots and off-hand anywhere in the same dimension when has a normal binding card and across dimensions when has a dimensional binding card."]
	quest.7D25B4381D37F798.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Pattern Provider&r in AE2 is the core component for &6automating crafting&r and processing, &6storing up to 54 encoded patterns&r per block. It pushes ingredients to adjacent machines (like Molecular Assemblers or furnaces) and &6can receive&r processed items back, acting as a crucial interface between the &bAE2 network and world machinery&r."
		""
		"The &bME Pattern Access Terminal&r is a specialized terminal that provides centralized &6remote access&r to all encoded &6patterns&r stored within all &bME Pattern Providers&r on your network. It &6allows you&r to view, add, or remove patterns from assemblers &6without physically visiting them&r, significantly speeding up &6auto-crafting management&r. "
	]
	quest.7D25B4381D37F798.quest_subtitle: "I like these patterns"
	quest.7D25B4381D37F798.title: "&bME Patterns&r"
	quest.7D52F644D7306C2F.quest_subtitle: "Engineer's Goggles are a wearable item that allow the user to see more details about placed machines."
	quest.7D52F644D7306C2F.title: "&6Oh Yeah Engineers Goggles&r"
	quest.7D541583C4BC2085.quest_desc: [
		"&6The Inscription Table is used for managing and upgrading your magical arsenal.&r "
		""
		"&6It allows you to safely insert or remove spells from your Spellbooks&r, ensuring you can customize your loadout for any situation."
	]
	quest.7D541583C4BC2085.quest_subtitle: "Take a Seat and Relax... Relax."
	quest.7D541583C4BC2085.title: "&6This is What I Really Need!&r"
	quest.7D568FD81FE57695.quest_desc: [
		"The &bAE2 Crafting Co-Processing Unit&r is an optional, stackable component for &6crafting CPU multiblocks&r that significantly &6boosts auto-crafting speeds&r. "
		""
		"By adding &bCo-processors&r, the system can parallelize &6tasks&r, allowing multiple &bMolecular Assemblers&r to work simultaneously on a single, complex recipe, reducing bottlenecking for &6faster production&r."
		""
		"And &bMEGA Crafting Co-Processing Unit&r is a &6high-tier&r, stackable crafting component that acts as four regular &6co-processors&r, allowing for &6massively increased automation&r speeds and, when paired with &6Mega Storage&r, handling huge, multi-step crafting jobs. It &6accelerates molecular assemblers&r by distributing item, fluid, or block crafting tasks in parallel. "
	]
	quest.7D568FD81FE57695.quest_subtitle: "i think they are fast and useful..."
	quest.7D568FD81FE57695.title: "&bCrafting Co-Processors&r"
